1. Theme palettes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The "Community" group in the theme library recreates well known colour schemes
by eye, as a tribute. No code, image or font from those projects is bundled, and
Kryonyx Music is not affiliated with or endorsed by any of them.

    Spotify            Spotify AB                  spotify.com
    Dracula            Zeno Rocha + contributors   draculatheme.com
    Nord               Arctic Ice Studio           nordtheme.com
    Gruvbox            morhetz                     github.com/morhetz/gruvbox
    Catppuccin         Catppuccin org              catppuccin.com
    Tokyo Night        enkia                       github.com/enkia/tokyo-night-vscode-theme
    Rose Pine          Rose Pine team              rosepinetheme.com
    Everforest         sainnhe                     github.com/sainnhe/everforest
